<article class="outcome tw-min-h-[172px] tw-rounded-[20px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[26px]"><div class="mini">LABOR</div><h3>Job &amp; Labor Data</h3><p>Capture transfers and labor-related selections so the transaction includes more than simply the time of the punch.</p></article>
<article class="outcome tw-min-h-[172px] tw-rounded-[20px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[26px]"><div class="mini">COMPLIANCE</div><h3>Attestation &amp; Controls</h3><p>Apply configured attestations, shift controls, sequencing and other punch rules directly in the employee workflow.</p></article>
<article class="outcome tw-min-h-[172px] tw-rounded-[20px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[26px]"><div class="mini">ACCURACY</div><h3>Validate at the Source</h3><p>Help prevent avoidable exceptions by controlling the employee interaction before workforce data moves downstream.</p></article>
<article class="outcome tw-min-h-[172px] tw-rounded-[20px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[26px]"><div class="mini">EXPERIENCE</div><h3>Employee Self-Service</h3><p>Extend the clock experience beyond punching with employee-facing workforce information and approved self-service workflows.</p></article>
<article class="outcome tw-min-h-[172px] tw-rounded-[20px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[26px]"><div class="mini">OPERATIONS</div><h3>Built for Enterprise Use</h3><p>Designed for resilient operation, continued synchronization, administrative controls and remote support across deployed fleets.</p></article>
