<section class="tt-section mist tw-bg-[#f5f7fa] tw-py-[64px] max-[720px]:tw-py-[52px]"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-head"><div class="eyebrow">CONFIGURABLE BY DESIGN</div><h2>Fit the Workflow to the Workforce.</h2><p>Start with a proven application foundation, then configure the workflow around your labor and policy requirements.</p></div><div class="tt-flex-grid tw-grid tw-grid-cols-2 tw-gap-[24px] max-[900px]:tw-grid-cols-1">
<div class="tt-panel tw-rounded-[22px] tw-border tw-border-[#dfe5ef] tw-bg-white tw-p-[32px]"><h3>A Strong Standard Foundation</h3><p>TimeTrack provides the common capabilities needed for modern time and labor collection on Ultima Series devices.</p><div class="tt-list"><span>Punch workflows</span><span>Labor transfers</span><span>Attestation</span><span>Lockout controls</span><span>Manager access</span><span>Administrative roles</span><span>Offline continuity</span><span>Remote diagnostics</span></div></div>
<div class="tt-panel dark tw-rounded-[22px] tw-border tw-border-[#211d63] tw-bg-[#211d63] tw-p-[32px] tw-text-white"><h3>Designed to Keep Evolving</h3><p>When a customer requirement goes beyond the standard experience, ZKTeco WFM can evaluate the need for configuration, reusable product enhancement or customer-specific development.</p><div class="fit-note"><strong>Customer need → solution fit → product gap → better standard.</strong><br/>The goal is not to force every workforce into the same workflow.</div></div>
</div><div class="platform-band tw-mt-[26px] tw-grid tw-grid-cols-2 tw-gap-[18px] max-[900px]:tw-grid-cols-1"><div class="platform-use"><strong>For Workday Customers</strong><span>TimeTrack powers the employee interaction on Ultima Series devices while CirrusDCS manages and exchanges workforce data with Workday through the Workday-connected solution.</span></div><div class="platform-use"><strong>For Software Partners</strong><span>TimeTrack and the Android API can reduce application-development effort while giving partners a flexible path to integrate their workforce platform with Ultima time clocks.</span></div></div></div></section>
